     <period-end iso-date="2028-12-11"></period-end>
     <target value="STEG&apos;s corporate governance, financial management, and transparency are improved with (i) the development of a multi-year financial model by STEG to allow multi-year planning, approved by its Board, (ii) the appointment of two independent members to the STEG Board of Directors, (iii) the disclosure of its financial statements in accordance with IFRS 8 disaggregated by activity (gas, electricity) and the approval of its income statements by function (generation, transmission, distribution), and (iv) the approval of its audited financial statements, prepared in accordance with IFRS accounting standards.">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">STEG attended a financial modeling training in Rabat from September 21 to 26, 2025, with a team of seven participants. Technical assistance has been initiated to support STEG in implementing a new financial model.</narrative>
